    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community Feedback</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/47c87185333090a940e8dbe96b2600ad.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Stellar Cardworks</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a robotic agent of the prestigious Interstellar Construction Bureau, your mission is simple: take on contracts to terraform planets into habitable colonies. Each world brings unique challenges\u2014limited resources, unexpected obstacles, and strategic decisions to make your colony thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/7d920a71cf61aeae4a9f3b0424caf296.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/7d920a71cf61aeae4a9f3b0424caf296.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/e3af0be5fc50b1b272769d23566e1db0.avif?t=1748487286\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Gameplay:</strong> Use various card types, including resources, tools, characters, and technology, to manage your planet's development effectively.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Decision-Making:</strong> Balance resource gathering, scientific advancements, and political tasks to meet project goals and optimize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sci-Fi Setting:</strong> Dive into a galaxy full of diverse planets, each with its own environmental conditions and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression:</strong> Complete tasks, improve planetary conditions, and unlock advanced cards to master the art of terraforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability &amp; Freedom</strong>: Each game offers fresh challenges with randomized events and numerous strategic paths to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/2c77a5bf8d4fda66f2a0e5872ac7461e.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/2c77a5bf8d4fda66f2a0e5872ac7461e.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/3099f77f06c03c5149e4c465f7b8d279.avif?t=1748487286\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the <i>Interstellar Construction Bureau</i>, you\u2019ll face the ultimate test of efficiency and creativity. Start by selecting a planet, review its unique requirements, and use your arsenal of tools and cards to transform it into a vibrant, habitable world. Each project pushes you to balance between time, resources, and profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to turn barren worlds into flourishing colonies and climb the ranks of the Interstellar Construction Bureau?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/c43994e7706fcac3660e120bd96b3944.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/c43994e7706fcac3660e120bd96b3944.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Stellar Cardworks</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a robotic agent of the prestigious Interstellar Construction Bureau, your mission is simple: take on contracts to terraform planets into habitable colonies. Each world brings unique challenges\u2014limited resources, unexpected obstacles, and strategic decisions to make your colony thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/7d920a71cf61aeae4a9f3b0424caf296.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/7d920a71cf61aeae4a9f3b0424caf296.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/e3af0be5fc50b1b272769d23566e1db0.avif?t=1748487286\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Gameplay:</strong> Use various card types, including resources, tools, characters, and technology, to manage your planet's development effectively.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Decision-Making:</strong> Balance resource gathering, scientific advancements, and political tasks to meet project goals and optimize profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sci-Fi Setting:</strong> Dive into a galaxy full of diverse planets, each with its own environmental conditions and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression:</strong> Complete tasks, improve planetary conditions, and unlock advanced cards to master the art of terraforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability &amp; Freedom</strong>: Each game offers fresh challenges with randomized events and numerous strategic paths to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/2c77a5bf8d4fda66f2a0e5872ac7461e.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/2c77a5bf8d4fda66f2a0e5872ac7461e.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/3099f77f06c03c5149e4c465f7b8d279.avif?t=1748487286\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the <i>Interstellar Construction Bureau</i>, you\u2019ll face the ultimate test of efficiency and creativity. Start by selecting a planet, review its unique requirements, and use your arsenal of tools and cards to transform it into a vibrant, habitable world. Each project pushes you to balance between time, resources, and profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to turn barren worlds into flourishing colonies and climb the ranks of the Interstellar Construction Bureau?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/c43994e7706fcac3660e120bd96b3944.poster.avif?t=1748487286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432100/extras/c43994e7706fcac3660e120bd96b3944.webm?t=1748487286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
